All connected players should experience the same important story event.

The ten transitions must connect the established campaign:

The Fallen City leads to The Silent Estates.

The Silent Estates leads to The Dead Mall.

The Dead Mall leads to The Dead Construction Zone.

The Dead Construction Zone leads to The Underground.

The Underground leads to The Forgotten Laboratory.

The Forgotten Laboratory leads to The Iron Graveyard.

The Iron Graveyard leads to Ground Zero.

Ground Zero leads to The Titanforged.

The Titanforged leads to The Final Signal.

The Final Signal receives the campaign conclusion and, if appropriate, a post-credits reveal.

Each cinematic must be unique and consistent with the story.

9.2 Synchronised playback
