When they reconnect, determine whether they should resume the cinematic, view a summary or continue with the current mission state.

9.3 Cinematic graphics
Preserve the game's ambitious ultra-realistic graphics direction in multiplayer cutscenes.

Include high-quality lighting, detailed environments, realistic animation, smoke, fire, dust, ash, reflections and cinematic sound.

Do not make multiplayer cinematics look like low-quality substitutes for the single-player presentation.

Use scalable rendering settings where required by performance.

